~ veldaclite
[i]A stray record sticks out from the tiles. It has a strange marking in it.[/i]
Veldaclite, an unknown organization outside space dedicated to securing and promoting "universal security".
They are responsible in containing and researching [i]space anomalies[/i].
On ▉▉▉▉▉▉▉, the ▉▉▉▉▉▉ descended to Krubilei and studied its inhabitants.
On ▉▉▉▉▉▉▉, the ▉▉▉▉▉▉ left Krubilei, which brought the end to their [b]study[/b].
